<title>SINGAPORE: UOB foreign shareholding at 39.6 pct.</title>
<headline>UOB foreign shareholding at 39.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Overseas Bank Ltd said on Thursday that foreign shareholders held 39.60 percent of the banking group as of February 13, 1997.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
